WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,460
Cool down first and don’t eat too much at one time

2
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,460
will i die

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,460
There's no point asking this now

4
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:13,760
Let me do what I say and I'm hungry

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:21,250
If you are hungry, it means you are back to normal. Thank you.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,250
Once your illness is over, you will have the strength to be violent.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:26,710
Mom, I'm fine

8
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:27,710
You stay away

9
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:29,710
