10
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,710
Don't worry, I'm not burning or shaking now

11
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:32,710
Still able to eat

12
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:33,710
I might be in better spirits than you are.

13
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,710
Your fever is gone

14
00:00:34,710 --> 00:00:35,710
