20
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:42,710
I keep burning it before eating it

21
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:44,710
Sweat to cool down after eating for a few hours

22
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,710
I dare not be able to cure any disease.

23
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:46,710
But at least it worked this time

24
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:47,710
Food can be found

25
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:48,710
Salt can boil

26
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:49,710
There are even medicines

27
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,710
Are you taking our side?

28
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:51,710
tell him everything

29
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:52,710
Just personally

30
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:53,710
I need to apply to you first
